    },
    {
      "id": "c-beishi-044-bei44:p003",
      "text": "子子元，秘書郎。後永安中，乃奏其父書，稱：「臣亡考散騎常侍、黃門侍郎、前將軍、齊州大中正鴻，",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-beishi-044-bei44:p003:m0001",
          "start": 1,
