          "surface": "子元",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "ih5_w5y_2s0",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "《魏書》《北史》稱崔鴻之子。墓誌錄文另書本名混；本批先錄兩史見證。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-beishi-044-bei44:p003:m0044",
          "start": 44,
          "end": 45,
          "surface": "鴻",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "30f_353_0e8",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "《魏書》《北史》崔光附傳之崔鴻，字彥鸞，敬友子。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-beishi-044-bei44:p004",
      "text": "子元後謀反，事發逃竄，會赦免，尋為其叔鶤所殺。",
